{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S08、S11、S12这些短停留段，感受提示仍然偏密，观众可能忙着追逐新出现的文字，反而顾不上听音乐；Y在这些段落更容易一眼扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然信息更密，但关键词突出、话与感受分层，而且感受按音乐进程出现，观众能抓住每段心理转折，同时听见音乐怎样推动情绪变化。尤其是旧歌、舞步、摇篮曲等反复出现的线索，让人物的怀念、动摇和逐渐接受形成了连续的体验，细腻程度也明显胜过Y。Y的双栏布局确实更容易快速扫读，但右侧短词有时像情绪清单，音乐变化与人物心理之间的联系不如X具体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0c0a1b72-331a-464c-8b08-48ca2e7448d2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172452488787Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.812, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:26:10.305996+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "90f9d2d29be2759c7e2dfb66374a76fd432a73123875fdaf0d5abd16386fcb91", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp